<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FreightOS — Trans Ontario Express</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=" crossorigin="" />
<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
<style>
:root {
  --royal-blue: #1F4AEE;
  --royal-blue-glow: rgba(31, 74, 238, 0.4);
  --royal-blue-dark: #1234b8;
  --black-russian: #030718;
  --sidebar-bg: #030718;
  --white-smoke: #F4F6F9;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --red: #EF4444;
  --red-light: #FEE2E2;
  --amber: #F59E0B;
  --amber-light: #FEF3C7;
  --green: #10B981;
  --green-light: #D1FAE5;
  --gray-50: #f9fafb;
  --gray-100: #f3f4f6;
  --gray-200: #e5e7eb;
  --gray-300: #d1d5db;
  --gray-400: #9ca3af;
  --gray-500: #6b7280;
  --gray-600: #4b5563;
  --gray-700: #374151;
  --gray-800: #1f2937;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(3,7,24,0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 14px rgba(3,7,24,0.08);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 30px rgba(3,7,24,0.12);
  --shadow-xl: 0 20px 40px rgba(3,7,24,0.18);
  --font-main: 'Montserrat', -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
}

* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: var(--font-main);
  background: var(--white-smoke);
  color: var(--black-russian);
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.app-container { display: flex; height: 100vh; width: 100vw; overflow: hidden; }

/* ============ SIDEBAR ============ */
.sidebar {
  width: 260px;
  min-width: 260px;
  background: var(--sidebar-bg);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  z-index: 1000;
  position: relative;
}

.sidebar-brand {
  padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
.brand-logo-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 10px 14px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  transition: transform 0.2s;
}
.brand-logo-card:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }
.brand-logo-card img { width: 100%; max-height: 48px; object-fit: contain; }

.live-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  color: var(--green);
  background: rgba(16,185,129,0.12);
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}
.live-pulse {
  width: 7px; height: 7px;
  background: var(--green);
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0.7);
  animation: pulse-green 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse-green {
  0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0.7); }
  70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(16,185,129,0); }
  100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16,185,129,0); }
}

.sidebar-nav {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 14px 12px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.nav-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  position: relative;
  user-select: none;
}
.nav-item:hover {
  color: #FFFFFF;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}
.nav-item.active {
  color: #FFFFFF;
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}
.nav-item svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.nav-badge {
  margin-left: auto;
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(239,68,68,0.5);
  animation: pulse-red 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse-red {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
}

.sidebar-footer {
  padding: 16px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}

/* ============ MAIN AREA ============ */
.main-area {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--white-smoke);
}

/* ============ TOPBAR ============ */
.topbar {
  height: 64px;
  min-height: 64px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 28px;
  gap: 18px;
  z-index: 50;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

.topbar-search {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: var(--gray-100);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 9px 18px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  flex: 0 0 300px;
}
.topbar-search:hover { border-color: var(--royal-blue); background: #FFFFFF; }
.topbar-search svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; color: var(--gray-400); }
.topbar-search span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray-500); flex: 1; }
.topbar-search kbd {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
  border-radius: 5px;
  padding: 2px 7px;
  color: var(--gray-600);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.topbar-date-badge {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(31,74,238,0.15);
  padding: 7px 16px;
  border-radius: 20px;
}
.date-pill {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}
.clock-pill {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--black-russian);
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.topbar-spacer { flex: 1; }

.topbar-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 9px 18px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  font-family: var(--font-main);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: var(--royal-blue-dark);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(31,74,238,0.4);
}
.btn-demo {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1F4AEE, #7C3AED);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(124,58,237,0.35);
}
.btn-demo:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(124,58,237,0.5);
}
.btn-secondary {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: var(--gray-700);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--gray-100); }
.btn-sm { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 6px; }

/* ============ CONTENT CONTAINER ============ */
.content {
  flex: 1;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  position: relative;
}
.page { display: none; animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-out; }
.page.active { display: block; }
@keyframes fadeIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* ============ CARDS ============ */
.card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }

/* ============ HERO BANNER ============ */
.hero-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #030718 0%, #0d163a 50%, #1F4AEE 100%);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 26px 32px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.hero-bg-truck {
  position: absolute;
  right: -20px;
  bottom: -20px;
  height: 125%;
  opacity: 0.18;
  pointer-events: none;
  filter: contrast(1.2);
}
.hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 620px; }
.hero-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  padding: 4px 12px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
}
.hero-title { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.hero-subtitle { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.88; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; }
.hero-stats-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 18px;
}
.hero-mini-stat {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.hero-mini-stat .val { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; }
.hero-mini-stat .lbl { font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.75; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }

/* ============ METRIC STAT CARDS ============ */
.metrics-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.stat-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 22px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
.stat-card-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.stat-icon-wrapper {
  width: 44px; height: 44px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.stat-icon-wrapper svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
.stat-number { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.stat-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray-500); }
.stat-footer {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding-top: 10px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-100);
  font-size: 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

/* ============ MAP PAGE (LEAFLET) ============ */
.map-view-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: calc(100vh - 120px);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
#liveLeafletMap { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.map-control-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  top: 16px;
  left: 16px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  z-index: 1000;
  max-width: 320px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.map-control-overlay h4 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.map-control-overlay p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray-500); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.map-legend-pills { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
.map-legend-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.legend-circle { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; }

/* ============ SIMULATOR & DEMO DIRECTOR ============ */
.simulator-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 420px;
  gap: 20px;
}
.sim-stage-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.sim-clock-display {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 24px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gray-50) 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.sim-time-huge {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 56px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--black-russian);
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.sim-date-tag {
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  color: white;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.sim-timeline-container { margin: 20px 0 28px; }
.sim-timeline-bar {
  height: 12px;
  background: var(--gray-200);
  border-radius: 6px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: visible;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.sim-timeline-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--royal-blue), #7C3AED);
  border-radius: 6px;
  transition: width 0.3s;
}
.sim-step-pin {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  width: 24px; height: 24px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 3px solid var(--royal-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  z-index: 5;
}
.sim-step-pin:hover, .sim-step-pin.active {
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.3);
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}

/* ============ STEP CARDS IN DIRECTOR ============ */
.director-steps-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
  max-height: 520px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding-right: 4px;
}
.director-step-item {
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  border: 2px solid var(--gray-200);
  background: #FFFFFF;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 14px;
}
.director-step-item:hover {
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.02);
}
.director-step-item.active {
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.05);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(31,74,238,0.12);
}
.director-step-item.completed {
  opacity: 0.65;
  border-color: var(--green);
}
.step-number-circle {
  width: 32px; height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--gray-100);
  color: var(--gray-700);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 13px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.director-step-item.active .step-number-circle {
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.step-details { flex: 1; }
.step-header-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.step-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--black-russian); }
.step-time-badge {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.08);
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 6px;
}
.step-action-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray-600); line-height: 1.4; }

.narration-live-box {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(31,74,238,0.06), rgba(124,58,237,0.06));
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(31,74,238,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 20px;
  margin-top: 18px;
  position: relative;
}
.narration-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.narration-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--gray-800); line-height: 1.6; }
.narration-problem-box {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--amber);
  padding: 10px 14px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--gray-700);
}

/* ============ TABLES ============ */
.data-table-container {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
.data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; }
.data-table th {
  background: var(--gray-50);
  padding: 14px 18px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gray-500);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
}
.data-table td {
  padding: 14px 18px;
  font-size: 13px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-100);
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.data-table tr:hover { background: rgba(31,74,238,0.02); cursor: pointer; }

/* Status Chips */
.chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.chip-assigned { background: rgba(31,74,238,0.1); color: var(--royal-blue); }
.chip-unassigned { background: var(--gray-200); color: var(--gray-700); }
.chip-at-risk { background: var(--amber-light); color: #B45309; }
.chip-late { background: var(--red-light); color: var(--red); }
.chip-done { background: var(--green-light); color: #047857; }

/* Confidence flags */
.conf-dot {
  width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: 4px;
}
.conf-provided { background: var(--green); }
.conf-estimated { background: var(--amber); }
.conf-missing { background: var(--red); }

/* Quick Filter Pills */
.filter-pills-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.filter-pill {
  padding: 8px 18px;
  border-radius: 24px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
  color: var(--gray-600);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  user-select: none;
}
.filter-pill:hover { border-color: var(--royal-blue); color: var(--royal-blue); }
.filter-pill.active {
  background: var(--royal-blue);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}

/* ============ DETAIL DRAWER ============ */
.drawer-backdrop {
  position: fixed; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(3,7,24,0.4);
  backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  z-index: 2000;
  opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.3s;
}
.drawer-backdrop.open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
.detail-drawer {
  position: fixed; top: 0; right: -520px; bottom: 0;
  width: 520px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  z-index: 2001;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  transition: right 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.detail-drawer.open { right: 0; }
.drawer-header {
  padding: 22px 28px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.drawer-header h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; }
.drawer-body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 28px; }

/* ============ TOAST ============ */
.toast-container {
  position: fixed; bottom: 24px; right: 28px; z-index: 3000;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
}
.toast {
  background: var(--black-russian);
  color: white;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  animation: slideToast 0.3s forwards;
  min-width: 320px;
}
@keyframes slideToast {
  from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
}

/* ============ MODAL ============ */
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(3,7,24,0.5);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  z-index: 4000;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
.modal-window {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  width: 90%; max-width: 680px;
  max-height: 85vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  animation: scaleModal 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
@keyframes scaleModal {
  from { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}
.modal-header {
  padding: 22px 28px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.modal-body { padding: 28px; }
.modal-footer {
  padding: 18px 28px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 12px;
}

/* Fix this options */
.recovery-card {
  border: 2px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.recovery-card:hover { border-color: var(--royal-blue); }
.recovery-card.selected {
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.03);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}

/* Testimonial banner */
.customer-banner {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 22px;
  margin-top: 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
}
.customer-banner img { width: 85px; height: 85px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; }

/* Live Pulsing Dot & Clock Toggle */
.live-pulse-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green);
  display: inline-block;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  animation: livePulse 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes livePulse {
  0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7); }
  70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
  100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
}
.clock-toggle-btn {
  background: #10B981;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 3px 9px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  margin-left: 6px;
}
.clock-toggle-btn.sim-active {
  background: var(--amber);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* Table Select Elements */
.table-select {
  padding: 5px 8px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-main);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
  background-color: #FFFFFF;
  cursor: pointer;
  outline: none;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  max-width: 100%;
}
.table-select:focus {
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}
.table-select-status.status-assigned {
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.1);
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  border-color: rgba(31,74,238,0.3);
}
.table-select-status.status-unassigned {
  background: var(--gray-100);
  color: var(--gray-700);
  border-color: var(--gray-300);
}
.table-select-status.status-at-risk {
  background: var(--amber-light);
  color: #B45309;
  border-color: #FCD34D;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.table-select-status.status-in-transit {
  background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
  color: #7C3AED;
  border-color: rgba(124,58,237,0.3);
}
.table-select-status.status-done {
  background: var(--green-light);
  color: #047857;
  border-color: #A7F3D0;
}
.table-select-vehicle.select-empty {
  color: var(--red);
  border-color: var(--red-light);
  background: #FFF5F5;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.row-at-risk {
  background-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) !important;
}
.btn-at-risk-active {
  background: var(--amber) !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  border: none !important;
}


/* Live Pulsing Dot & Clock Toggle */
.live-pulse-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green);
  display: inline-block;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  animation: livePulse 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes livePulse {
  0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7); }
  70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
  100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
}
.clock-toggle-btn {
  background: #10B981;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 3px 9px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  margin-left: 6px;
}
.clock-toggle-btn.sim-active {
  background: var(--amber);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* Table Select Elements */
.table-select {
  padding: 5px 8px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-main);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
  background-color: #FFFFFF;
  cursor: pointer;
  outline: none;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  max-width: 100%;
}
.table-select:focus {
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--royal-blue-glow);
}
.table-select-status.status-assigned {
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.1);
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  border-color: rgba(31,74,238,0.3);
}
.table-select-status.status-unassigned {
  background: var(--gray-100);
  color: var(--gray-700);
  border-color: var(--gray-300);
}
.table-select-status.status-at-risk {
  background: var(--amber-light);
  color: #B45309;
  border-color: #FCD34D;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.table-select-status.status-in-transit {
  background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
  color: #7C3AED;
  border-color: rgba(124,58,237,0.3);
}
.table-select-status.status-done {
  background: var(--green-light);
  color: #047857;
  border-color: #A7F3D0;
}
.table-select-vehicle.select-empty {
  color: var(--red);
  border-color: var(--red-light);
  background: #FFF5F5;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.row-at-risk {
  background-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05) !important;
}
.btn-at-risk-active {
  background: var(--amber) !important;
  color: #FFFFFF !important;
  border: none !important;
}


/* ============ RESPONSIVE MOBILE & TABLET STYLES ============ */
.mobile-menu-btn {
  display: none;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-300);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--black-russian);
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: all 0.2s;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}
.mobile-menu-btn:hover {
  background: var(--gray-100);
  border-color: var(--royal-blue);
}

.mobile-close-btn {
  display: none;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  border: none;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.mobile-close-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
}

.sidebar-backdrop {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(3, 7, 24, 0.65);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  z-index: 1998;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
}
.sidebar-backdrop.open {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
}

.mobile-scroll-hint {
  display: none;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--royal-blue);
  background: rgba(31,74,238,0.06);
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* TABLET & MOBILE BREAKPOINT (<= 992px) */
@media (max-width: 992px) {
  .mobile-menu-btn { display: inline-flex; }
  .mobile-close-btn { display: flex; }
  .sidebar-backdrop { display: block; }
  .mobile-scroll-hint { display: block; }

  /* Off-canvas mobile sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    position: fixed !important;
    top: 0 !important;
    left: 0 !important;
    bottom: 0 !important;
    width: 280px !important;
    min-width: 280px !important;
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    z-index: 1999 !important;
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.5) !important;
  }
  .sidebar.mobile-open {
    transform: translateX(0) !important;
  }

  .app-container {
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
  }

  .main-area {
    width: 100vw;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .topbar {
    padding: 0 16px;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .topbar-search {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding: 8px 12px;
  }
  .topbar-search span, .topbar-search kbd {
    display: none;
  }

  .metrics-row {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr) !important;
    gap: 12px !important;
  }

  .simulator-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    gap: 16px !important;
  }

  .map-view-wrapper {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    height: auto !important;
  }
  #liveLeafletMap {
    height: 380px !important;
    min-height: 380px !important;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 16px !important;
  }
}

/* SMARTPHONE BREAKPOINT (<= 640px) */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .topbar {
    height: auto !important;
    min-height: 56px !important;
    padding: 8px 12px !important;
    flex-wrap: wrap !important;
    gap: 8px !important;
  }

  .topbar-search {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .topbar-date-badge {
    padding: 4px 8px !important;
    gap: 5px !important;
  }
  .date-pill {
    font-size: 11px !important;
  }
  .clock-pill {
    font-size: 12px !important;
  }
  .clock-toggle-btn {
    padding: 2px 6px !important;
    font-size: 9px !important;
  }

  .topbar-actions {
    gap: 6px !important;
  }
  .topbar-actions .btn {
    padding: 6px 10px !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 12px 10px !important;
  }

  .metrics-row {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    gap: 10px !important;
  }

  .hero-card {
    padding: 20px 16px !important;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 19px !important;
    line-height: 1.3 !important;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 12px !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }
  .hero-stats-row {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;
    gap: 8px !important;
  }
  .hero-mini-stat {
    padding: 8px 12px !important;
  }
  .hero-mini-stat .val {
    font-size: 16px !important;
  }

  /* Full-width Responsive Detail Drawer on Phones */
  .detail-drawer {
    width: 100% !important;
    right: -100% !important;
  }
  .detail-drawer.open {
    right: 0 !important;
  }
  .drawer-header {
    padding: 16px 20px !important;
  }
  .drawer-body {
    padding: 18px 16px !important;
  }

  /* Filter pills horizontal scrolling */
  .filter-pills-row {
    gap: 6px !important;
    overflow-x: auto !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    padding-bottom: 6px !important;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch !important;
  }
  .filter-pill {
    padding: 6px 12px !important;
    font-size: 11px !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
  }

  /* Table horizontal scroll container */
  .data-table-container {
    overflow-x: auto !important;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md) !important;
  }
  .data-table {
    min-width: 780px !important;
  }

  /* Responsive Fix Modal */
  .modal-dialog {
    width: 95vw !important;
    max-width: 95vw !important;
    margin: 10px auto !important;
  }
  .modal-content {
    padding: 16px !important;
    max-height: 88vh !important;
    overflow-y: auto !important;
  }

  /* Simulator controls */
  .sim-clock-display {
    padding: 14px !important;
  }
  .sim-time-huge {
    font-size: 30px !important;
  }
  .sim-timeline-bar {
    overflow-x: auto !important;
  }

  /* Fleet Grid */
  #fleetCardsGrid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="app-container">
  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <div class="sidebar-backdrop" id="sidebarBackdrop" onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()"></div>
  <aside class="sidebar" id="appSidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-brand">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
        <div class="brand-logo-card" style="flex:1;">
      <div class="brand-logo-card">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Trans Ontario Express" />
        </div>
        <button class="mobile-close-btn" onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()" aria-label="Close navigation menu">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-top:8px;">
        <span class="live-badge"><span class="live-pulse"></span> LIVE DISPATCH</span>
        <span style="font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); font-weight:600;">TEAM #16</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav class="sidebar-nav">
      <div class="nav-item active" onclick="navigateTo('dashboard')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>
        <span>Dashboard</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('simulator')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        <span>Simulator & Demo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('map')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="18"/><line x1="16" y1="6" x2="16" y2="22"/></svg>
        <span>Interactive Map</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('shipments')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
        <span>Shipments</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('fleet')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
        <span>Fleet Capacity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('exceptions')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        <span>Exceptions</span>
        <span class="nav-badge" id="exceptionCountBadge">7</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('impact')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
        <span>Impact Scorecard</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="navigateTo('assumptions')">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
        <span>Assumptions</span>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <div style="font-weight:700; color:#FFFFFF;">FreightOS Enterprise v2.4</div>
      <div>GTA & Canada Transport System</div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- MAIN AREA -->
  <div class="main-area">
    <!-- TOP BAR -->
    <header class="topbar">
      <!-- Mobile Hamburger Button -->
      <button class="mobile-menu-btn" id="mobileMenuBtn" onclick="toggleMobileSidebar()" aria-label="Open Navigation Menu">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" style="width:20px;height:20px;"><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
      </button>
      <div class="topbar-search" onclick="openCommandBar()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        <span>Search shipments, trucks, routes…</span>
        <kbd>Ctrl+K</kbd>
      </div>

      <!-- DATE CHANGER & TIME DISPLAY (LIVE TICKING WALL CLOCK) -->
      <div class="topbar-date-badge">
        <div class="date-pill" id="topbarDateBadge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="width:15px;height:15px;"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
          <span id="topbarDateLabel">Oct 17, 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="clock-pill" id="topbarTimeDisplay">
          <span class="live-pulse-dot" id="liveClockDot"></span>
          <span id="topbarTimeText">08:00:00 AM</span>
        </div>
        <button class="clock-toggle-btn" id="clockToggleBtn" onclick="toggleClockMode()" title="Toggle Live Wall Clock / Simulator Time">LIVE</button>
      </div>

      <div class="topbar-spacer"></div>

      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="undoLastAction()" title="Undo last dispatch change (Ctrl+Z)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="width:15px;height:15px;"><polyline points="1 4 1 10 7 10"/><path d="M3.51 15a9 9 0 1 0 2.13-9.36L1 10"/></svg>
          Undo
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-demo" onclick="startLiveDemoDirector()">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="width:16px;height:16px;"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
          Director Walkthrough
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- CONTENT PAGES -->
    <div class="content">

      <!-- ================= PAGE: DASHBOARD ================= -->
      <div class="page active" id="page-dashboard">
        <!-- Hero card with asset image -->
        <div class="hero-card">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," class="hero-bg-truck" alt="Trans Ontario Truck" />
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-pill">🏆 40 YEARS OF SERVICE · TRANS ONTARIO EXPRESS</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">AI-Powered Logistics Control Tower</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Real-time dispatch optimization, automated load matching, and instant disruption recovery for 247 shipments across Ontario & Canada.</p>
            <div class="hero-stats-row">
              <div class="hero-mini-stat">
                <span class="val">342 km</span>
                <span class="lbl">Saved Today</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-mini-stat">
                <span class="val">96.3%</span>
                <span class="lbl">Fewer Late Stops</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-mini-stat">
                <span class="val">$1,480</span>
                <span class="lbl">Fuel & Labor Saved</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:14px 24px; font-size:14px; background:#FFFFFF; color:var(--royal-blue);" onclick="navigateTo('simulator')">
              Launch Interactive Demo →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Metric Cards (DYNAMIC REAL-TIME COUNTERS) -->
        <div class="metrics-row">
          <div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('shipments')">
            <div class="stat-card-header">
              <span class="stat-label">Total GTA Orders</span>
              <div class="stat-icon-wrapper" style="background:rgba(31,74,238,0.1); color:var(--royal-blue);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number" id="statTotalShipments">75</div>
            <div class="stat-footer">
              <span style="color:var(--green); font-weight:700;" id="statAssignedSub">39 Assigned</span>
              <span style="color:var(--gray-400);">Verified Simple Day Dataset</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('shipments');filterTable('unassigned', document.getElementById('pill-unassigned'))">
            <div class="stat-card-header">
              <span class="stat-label">Unassigned Orders</span>
              <div class="stat-icon-wrapper" style="background:var(--red-light); color:var(--red);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number" id="statUnassigned" style="color:var(--red);">30</div>
            <div class="stat-footer">
              <span style="color:var(--red); font-weight:700;" id="statUnassignedLabel">Needs Dispatcher</span>
              <span style="color:var(--royal-blue); font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;" onclick="event.stopPropagation();triggerAutoPlan()">Run AI Planner ⚡</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('fleet')">
            <div class="stat-card-header">
              <span class="stat-label">Fleet Active</span>
              <div class="stat-icon-wrapper" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1); color:var(--green);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number" id="statFleetActive">7<span style="font-size:18px; color:var(--gray-400); font-weight:500;">/8</span></div>
            <div class="stat-footer">
              <span style="color:var(--green); font-weight:700;" id="statFleetUtilization">76% Avg Load</span>
              <span>1 Reserve Truck</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card" onclick="navigateTo('exceptions')">
            <div class="stat-card-header">
              <span class="stat-label">Active Exceptions</span>
              <div class="stat-icon-wrapper" style="background:var(--amber-light); color:var(--amber);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number" id="statActiveExceptions" style="color:var(--amber);">7</div>
            <div class="stat-footer">
              <span style="color:var(--red); font-weight:700;" id="statBreakdownSub">1 Breakdown Alert</span>
              <span>Instant AI Fix Ready</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2 Column Overview -->
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px;">
          <div class="card" style="padding:24px;">
            <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:16px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
              <span>Today's Real-Time Event Log</span>
              <span style="font-size:12px; color:var(--royal-blue); cursor:pointer;" onclick="navigateTo('simulator')">Live Replay →</span>
            </h3>
            <div id="dashboardEventLog" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; max-height:300px; overflow-y:auto;"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;">
            <div>
              <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px;">Logistics Problem Solver Overview</h3>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.5;">
                Trans Ontario operates 300–500 freight stops across the GTA daily. Historically, manual routing caused vehicle overloads, duplicate visits to same customers (12% of stops), and 54 late appointments on a single day.
              </p>
              <div style="margin-top:16px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;">
                <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--green);">
                  ✓ Hard rules block equipment and weight overloads before dispatch
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--green);">
                  ✓ Heuristic solver pairs Pickups before Deliveries automatically
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--green);">
                  ✓ 3-way ranked disaster recovery when vehicles break down
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; margin-top:20px;">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" style="flex:1; justify-content:center;" onclick="triggerAutoPlan()">⚡ Suggest Full Plan</button>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" style="flex:1; justify-content:center;" onclick="navigateTo('map')">Open Map View</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Customer Testimonial & Heritage Banner -->
        <div class="customer-banner">
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Traffic Manager" />
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--royal-blue); text-transform:uppercase;">Client Success · Traffic Manager Endorsement</div>
            <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--black-russian); margin:4px 0 6px;">
              "Trans Ontario's commitment to precision delivery across the GTA has kept our supply chain running flawlessly. The transition to intelligent dispatching sets a new standard in freight."
            </p>
            <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--gray-500);">Leading GTA Distribution Center — Scarborough, ON</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: SIMULATOR & DEMO DIRECTOR ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-simulator">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div>
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900;">Dispatch Simulator & Demo Director</h1>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500);">Step through the 7-phase real day scenario with automated live actions and full reasoning.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
            <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="resetSimulator()">⟲ Reset Day</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="playSimBtn" onclick="toggleSimPlay()">▶ Auto Play (5s/step)</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="simulator-layout">
          <!-- Stage Left: Interactive Timeline & Live Simulation View -->
          <div class="sim-stage-card">
            <div class="sim-clock-display">
              <div>
                <span class="sim-date-tag" id="simDateDisplay">FRIDAY, SEP 18, 2026</span>
              </div>
              <div class="sim-time-huge" id="simClockBig">08:00 AM</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Timeline Scrubber -->
            <div class="sim-timeline-container">
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--gray-500); margin-bottom:8px;">
                <span>08:00 AM (Morning)</span>
                <span>12:00 PM (Midday)</span>
                <span>05:00 PM (End of Day)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="sim-timeline-bar" id="simTimelineBar" onclick="seekTimeline(event)">
                <div class="sim-timeline-fill" id="simTimelineFill" style="width: 0%;"></div>
                <!-- 7 pins placed along timeline -->
                <div class="sim-step-pin active" style="left: 0%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(0)" title="Step 1: 08:00">1</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 16%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(1)" title="Step 2: 08:15">2</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 33%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(2)" title="Step 3: 08:30">3</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 50%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(3)" title="Step 4: 10:15">4</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 66%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(4)" title="Step 5: 11:30">5</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 83%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(5)" title="Step 6: 14:00">6</div>
                <div class="sim-step-pin" style="left: 100%;" onclick="jumpToDemoStep(6)" title="Step 7: 17:00">7</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Active Narration Box -->
            <div class="narration-live-box" id="liveNarrationCard">
              <div class="narration-badge" id="narrationStepBadge">STEP 1 OF 7 · SCENARIO INTRO</div>
              <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--black-russian);" id="narrationHeading">08:00 AM — Morning Dispatch Snapshot</h3>
              <p class="narration-text" id="narrationBody">
                "This is a real day's work. 247 orders have arrived. 38 are unassigned, 14 are at risk of missing delivery windows, and 7 exceptions need dispatcher attention before trucks hit the GTA highways."
              </p>
              <div class="narration-problem-box" id="narrationProblemBox">
                <strong>💡 Problem It Solves:</strong> Identifies unassigned orders and equipment mismatches before morning dispatch rather than discovering failures mid-route.
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-top:16px;">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="prevDemoStep()">← Previous</button>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
                  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="stepActionBtn" onclick="executeStepAction()">Execute Step Action ⚡</button>
                  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="nextDemoStep()">Next Step →</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Mini Action Visualizer -->
            <div style="margin-top:20px; border-radius:var(--radius-md); background:var(--gray-100); padding:16px; border:1px solid var(--gray-200);">
              <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--gray-600); margin-bottom:8px;">LIVE SYSTEM RESPONSE</div>
              <div id="simLiveFeedback" style="font-size:13px; font-family:var(--font-mono); color:var(--royal-blue); font-weight:600;">
                System ready. Awaiting step action.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Stage Right: Step Selector & Explanation -->
          <div class="card" style="padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
            <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:14px;">Director Step Sequence</h3>
            <div class="director-steps-list" id="directorStepsList"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: INTERACTIVE MAP ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-map">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900;">Interactive GTA Route Map</h1>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500);">Real GPS coordinates and optimized routes for Trans Ontario's Greater Toronto Area fleet.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
            <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="mapFitToronto()">Center GTA</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="toggleMapRoutes()">Toggle Truck Trails</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="map-view-wrapper">
          <div id="liveLeafletMap"></div>
          <div class="map-control-overlay">
            <h4>Trans Ontario Fleet Radar</h4>
            <p>Live active routes & stop clusters</p>
            <div class="map-legend-pills">
              <div class="map-legend-row">
                <div class="legend-circle" style="background:#1F4AEE;"></div>
                <span>T-205 (Straight Truck) — Mississauga</span>
              </div>
              <div class="map-legend-row">
                <div class="legend-circle" style="background:#10B981;"></div>
                <span>T-112 (Cargo Van) — Markham / Scarborough</span>
              </div>
              <div class="map-legend-row">
                <div class="legend-circle" style="background:#7C3AED;"></div>
                <span>T-445 (53ft Tractor) — 401 Corridor</span>
              </div>
              <div class="map-legend-row">
                <div class="legend-circle" style="background:#EF4444;"></div>
                <span>T-108 (Breakdown) — Don Valley / 401</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:14px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--gray-200); font-size:11px; color:var(--gray-500);">
              Click on any truck marker or customer stop circle for payload info.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: SHIPMENTS ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-shipments">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900;">Shipments Management</h1>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500);">Verified pair-legs, dangerous goods compliance, and confidence data indicators.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="triggerAutoPlan()">⚡ Suggest Full Plan</button>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-pills-row" id="shipmentFilterPills">
          <div class="filter-pill active" id="pill-all" onclick="filterTable('all', this)">All (<span id="countAll">75</span>)</div>
          <div class="filter-pill" id="pill-unassigned" onclick="filterTable('unassigned', this)">Unassigned (<span id="countUnassigned">30</span>)</div>
          <div class="filter-pill" id="pill-at-risk" onclick="filterTable('at-risk', this)">At Risk (<span id="countAtRisk">14</span>)</div>
          <div class="filter-pill" id="pill-rush" onclick="filterTable('rush', this)">Rush / Same-Day (<span id="countRush">22</span>)</div>
          <div class="filter-pill" id="pill-dg" onclick="filterTable('dg', this)">⚠ Dangerous Goods (<span id="countDg">7</span>)</div>
          <div class="filter-pill" id="pill-missing" onclick="filterTable('missing', this)">Missing Data (<span id="countMissing">31</span>)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="mobile-scroll-hint">👈 Swipe table horizontally to see all columns & truck selectors 👉</div>
        <div class="data-table-container">
          <table class="data-table" id="shipmentsTable">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th style="width:110px;">Order ID</th>
                <th style="width:75px;">Leg</th>
                <th>Customer</th>
                <th>Address</th>
                <th style="width:125px;">Service</th>
                <th style="width:115px;">Weight</th>
                <th style="width:145px;">Status</th>
                <th style="width:175px;">Assigned Vehicle</th>
                <th style="width:170px;">Quick Actions</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="shipmentsTableBody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: FLEET ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-fleet">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div>
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900;">Fleet Capacity & Driver Hours</h1>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500);">Legal weight limits, linear feet, skid counts, and Canadian Hours of Service tracking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap:18px;" id="fleetCardsGrid"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: EXCEPTIONS ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-exceptions">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
          <div>
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900;">Disruptions & Exceptions Inbox</h1>
            <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500);">Prioritized operational failures with 3-way ranked automated recovery plans.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="exceptionsCardsList" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: IMPACT SCORECARD ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-impact">
        <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:4px;">Impact Scorecard: Plan vs. Actual Day</h1>
        <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500); margin-bottom:24px;">Direct mathematical comparison between what drivers actually drove on Sep 18 vs. FreightOS automated routing.</p>

        <div class="metrics-row">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Total Travel Distance</div>
            <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:8px 0;">
              <span class="stat-number" style="color:var(--royal-blue);">1,247</span>
              <span style="font-size:16px; color:var(--gray-400); text-decoration:line-through;">1,589 km</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color:var(--green); font-weight:700; font-size:13px;">↓ 21.5% (342 km saved)</div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Driver On-Duty Hours</div>
            <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:8px 0;">
              <span class="stat-number" style="color:var(--royal-blue);">89.5</span>
              <span style="font-size:16px; color:var(--gray-400); text-decoration:line-through;">112.3 hrs</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color:var(--green); font-weight:700; font-size:13px;">↓ 20.3% (22.8 hours saved)</div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Late Customer Stops</div>
            <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:8px 0;">
              <span class="stat-number" style="color:var(--green);">2</span>
              <span style="font-size:16px; color:var(--red); text-decoration:line-through;">54 late</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color:var(--green); font-weight:700; font-size:13px;">↓ 96.3% reduction in late stops</div>
          </div>

          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-label">Plan Resilience Score</div>
            <div class="stat-number" style="color:var(--royal-blue);">87<span style="font-size:18px; color:var(--gray-400); font-weight:500;">/100</span></div>
            <div style="color:var(--gray-600); font-size:12px; font-weight:600;">Can absorb 2 vehicle failures</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:28px;">
          <h3 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:18px;">Key Financial & Operational Outcomes</h3>
          <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:20px;">
            <div style="padding:16px; background:var(--gray-50); border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
              <div style="font-weight:700; color:var(--royal-blue); margin-bottom:6px;">Fuel & Emission Savings</div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.5;">
                At an average commercial consumption of 32L/100km for diesel straight trucks, saving 342 km eliminates 109.4 Liters of diesel daily (~$218/day in fuel alone).
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding:16px; background:var(--gray-50); border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
              <div style="font-weight:700; color:var(--royal-blue); margin-bottom:6px;">Driver Overtime Elimination</div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.5;">
                Saving 22.8 driver-hours across 42 routes directly eliminates costly end-of-day overtime and avoids drivers hitting the strict 13-hour driving limits.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding:16px; background:var(--gray-50); border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
              <div style="font-weight:700; color:var(--royal-blue); margin-bottom:6px;">Fleet Asset Efficiency</div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.5;">
                Carrying out the day with 38 vehicles instead of 42 frees up 4 trucks at the depot for maintenance or profitable emergency on-demand cross-border loads.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ================= PAGE: ASSUMPTIONS ================= -->
      <div class="page" id="page-assumptions">
        <h1 style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:4px;">Documented Assumptions & Data Transparency</h1>
        <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-500); margin-bottom:24px;">As required by Section 11 of the Trans Ontario Blueprint, all estimates are openly disclosed.</p>
        <div id="assumptionsContainer" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ DETAIL DRAWER ============ -->
<div class="drawer-backdrop" id="drawerBackdrop" onclick="closeDetailDrawer()"></div>
<div class="detail-drawer" id="detailDrawer">
  <div class="drawer-header">
    <h3 id="drawerHeaderTitle">Shipment Details</h3>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="closeDetailDrawer()">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="drawer-body" id="drawerContentBody"></div>
</div>

<!-- ============ FIX THIS MODAL ============ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="fixThisModal">
  <div class="modal-window">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3 id="fixModalHeading">Recovery Plan Optimizer</h3>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="closeFixModal()">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body" id="fixModalContent"></div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="closeFixModal()">Cancel</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="applySelectedFix()">Apply Selected Fix</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ TOAST CONTAINER ============ -->
<div class="toast-container" id="toastContainer"></div>

